      "text": "The IRGC:\n\nThe insistence of the arrogant US regime on encouraging ships to illegally pass through the mine-filled passage has increased maritime navigation incidents day by day. The aggressive US military must understand that if this course continues, the scope of the confrontation will extend to the aggressive bases in the region. This is a serious warning.",
